# iTerm2's Natural Text Editing delete keys work: Alt+Delete (Esc d) deletes the next word, Delete (Ctrl+D) the next character, and Cmd+Backspace (Ctrl+U) back to the start.
file <<END
- alpha beta gamma delta
END
see alpha beta gamma delta
keys <Enter> <Home> <A-d> <C-d> <A-Del>
see -  gamma delta
keys <C-e> <A-b> <C-u>
type x
keys <Space>
keys <Esc>
see - x delta
quit
saved <<END
- x delta
END
